    },
    {
      "id": "14:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:4603:4605"
    },
    {
      "id": "14:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我也爱你。”你转过头去也亲了一下查理。“去，去！我还要做晚饭呢。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:4605:4641"
    },
    {
      "id": "14:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你又在厨房里忙活起来。查理一下坐到床上。“真高兴我们来了这里。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:4641:4675"
    },
    {
      "id": "14:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我也是。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:4675:4683"
    },
    {
      "id": "14:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我觉得确实是对我们有好处，你说呢？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:4683:4704"
    },
    {
      "id": "14:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“是啊。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:4704:4711"
    },
    {
      "id": "14:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“就像奥布莱恩医生和我们说的一样，”查理盯着电视屏幕上小屋变形的倒影，“远离一切，只关注我们自己，这样真好。我感觉真的很治愈……”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:4711:4778"
    },
    {
      "id": "14:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要聊聊明天的计划，转到 18。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:4778:4795"
    },
    {
      "id": "14:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要安慰查理，转到 15。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:4795:4809"
    }
  ]
}
